    {
      "id": "glm83x",
      "label": "takagi_rescue",
      "bg": "bg moon",
      "music": "yugioh.ogg",
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "3xcxef",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "cellphone",
          "side": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "9d9ycp",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Why do you have the neighbour's number? And on speed dial?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "fluptj",
          "type": "music",
          "music": "happy.ogg"
        },
        {
          "id": "l5syhp",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Before you can explain the sitation, Takagi picks up."
        },
        {
          "id": "vasjmt",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "hey lol i thought u forgot about me. what's the haps dude",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "kiaf9r",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "You tell Takagi that you need to track Moneybags' escape pod to prevent him from summoning an all-powerful Heartless."
        },
        {
          "id": "e8oxcx",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "ok no prob, i'll just hack the satellite mainframe and track his movements from there.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "nkugza",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "im in",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "twfo05",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "lmao good news, i found him. ur not gonna be able to drive there tho.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "k0bcdu",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "What's the matter? He's left the dang country?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "qja3re",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "u could say that lmao. his escape pod is headed for the moon.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "v57z2z",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "bloodstain neutral",
          "side": "right"
        },
        {
          "id": "rm5tis",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "d7paq9vm",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Masaka! Even if we commandeer a spacecraft, there's no way we can reach him in time!",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "22v5ln",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "cool your jets amazing athiest i got this. your ride will be there in a sec.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "yamnqh",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Takagi hangs up the phone."
        },
        {
          "id": "lt851u",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "pjotr happy at left behind cellphone",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "letp4p",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "iawlw7rq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Little girl is very resourceful. You are lucky to have kind neighbours. My own neighbour lets dog defecate on lawn and does not clean.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "kgfgdq",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Well, with the internet and everything, they say kids are learning way faster than we ever could.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "e8doti",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "bg labspaceship",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ocfh2s",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "A massive spacecraft crashes through the ceiling of the facility, shaking the ground with the intensity of a small earthquake."
        },
        {
          "id": "xghirv",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "takagi ok",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "raxsoo",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "get in losers! we're going to the moon",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "3rinbz",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "krabs neutral",
          "side": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "noifwj",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "88vorrtj",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "I've always wanted to fly first class off the planet! Come on lads, I get shotgun!",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "3itqhk",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "hank friendly",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "vmw31b",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "You built this thing yourself, Takagi? Are you sure it's safe?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "hmqqj4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "don't worry man i got seatbelts and everything. hurry up i left it idling",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "dt1fzp",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Well okay, I guess we have no other choice.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "6tqrat",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "You and the group climb aboard Takagi's spaceship. You're barely given a chance to sit down before she takes off for the moon. The ride is short and uneventful, if a little bumpy."
        },
        {
          "id": "dajsf7",
          "type": "bg",
          "bg": "bg moon"
        },
        {
          "id": "um6nk5",
          "type": "music",
          "music": "space.ogg"
        },
        {
          "id": "gsyrho",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "void neutral at rightish",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "k9hzqo",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "uah68u25",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "We made it! I thought for sure it would've exploded way before we made it to the moon.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "gjyyoa",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "takagi smug",
          "side": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "l2uhrk",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "wow thanks for the vote of confidence. unfriended and blocked, i don't deal with haters",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ngxzkz",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "hank determined",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "6k6d5c",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Come on crew, we're here, we can breathe in space, let's stop Moneybags.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ndap1r",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "uah68u25",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Wait a minute, that's a good point. How come we can breathe in space but we couldn't get through the water earlier without Captain Krabs helping us?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "cawce1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "The power of the Keyblade is a strange and unpredictable thing. Look, I think I see them in the background.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ap6kpr",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "no those are just regular astronauts. they're taking rock samples or something idk.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "rh9bl1",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "moneybags space",
          "side": "right"
        },
        {
          "id": "2twu5g",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ij4bvggx",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "So, you've followed me even here. I'm beginning to think I should've taken out a restraining order on you.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "5op4e6",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "bloodstain katana at leftish",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "znbiw7",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "d7paq9vm",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "No restraining order can stop a Pitchford! This is the end, Moneybags. You have nowhere left to run.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "h9m73o",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "vexi5q66",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "yeah we're gonna stop your evil plan and stuff. what was his evil plan btw",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "j6mtif",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ws42qjvq",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "We can fill you in on the details later. Right now, we need to stop him from summoning the mother of all Heartless.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "h993sj",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ij4bvggx",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Oh, but it's far too late for that!",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "0gxzql",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "danger dragon",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "2v0iu1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ij4bvggx",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "I tribute Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon,",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "u1qsue",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "danger pikachu",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "vkyk5f",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ij4bvggx",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "a Pokemon created by the devil's dark magick,",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "um0emp",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "danger medusa",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "wsim6l",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "ij4bvggx",
